{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T07:43:30+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-11-12T07:43:30+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Lectra SA","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Application","country":"France","city":"Paris","website":"https://www.lectra.com","employees":2700,"summary":"Lectra SA provides industrial intelligence solutions for fashion, automotive, furniture markets, and other industries in Europe, the Americas, the Asia Pacific, and internationally. The company offers SaaS solutions; connected and intelligent industrial equipment for fabric, leather, composite materials and technical textiles; data solutions; and consulting, training, support and maintenance. It also sells consumables and parts for its automated cutting equipment, as well as engages in the design and production of fabric spreading and cutting machines for fashion apparel, furnishing, and technical textiles. Lectra SA was incorporated in 1973 and is headquartered in Paris, France.","exchange":"Paris","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Lectra SA fournit des solutions d'intelligence industrielle pour les marchés de la mode, de l'automobile, de l'ameublement et d'autres industries en Europe, en Amérique, en Asie-Pacifique et à l'international. La société propose des solutions SaaS, des équipements industriels connectés et intelligents pour le tissu, le cuir, les matériaux composites et les textiles techniques, des solutions de données, ainsi que du conseil, de la formation, du support et de la maintenance. Elle vend également des consommables et des pièces pour ses équipements de coupe automatisés, ainsi que la conception et la production de machines d'épandage et de découpe de tissus pour les vêtements de mode, l'ameublement et les textiles techniques."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":723947904,"shares_outstanding":36823392,"trailing_pe":28.492754,"forward_pe